              "value": "`holdDetails` -> {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_PRICE_ORDER_DETAILS_FOR_DISPLAY.$output.orders}}\n\nholdCount = {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_PRICE_ORDER_DETAILS_FOR_DISPLAY.$output.TotalCount}} \n\n--Generate a Card widget with following details:\nSubject: \"\"\nSummary: If `holdDetails` has items and count of item elements > 0 then render \"<holdCount > Orders Pending Review. Check Priority Actions.\" else \"No Orders on price hold\".\nVariant: If `holdDetails` has items and count of item elements > 0 then render \"warning\" else \"info\"\nbadgeText:  If `holdDetails` has items and count of item elements > 0 then render \"Review\" else \"\"\n\n**Do not render any other content outside the Card widget."
