          "code": "RENDERCONFIRMATIONWIDGET",
          "id": "1776575839771",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776575839773_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "CONTEXT BINDINGS\n- OrderNumber := {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result.OrderNumber}}\n- HeaderId := {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result.HeaderId}}\n- HoldCode := {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result.HoldCode}}\n- HoldName := {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result.HoldName}}\n- HoldDescription := {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result.HoldDescription}}\n- MatchPercentage := {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result.MatchPercentage}}\n- HoldComments := {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result.HoldComments}}\n- LoggedInUser := {{$context.$app.$OraUserContext.fullName}} \n\n\nRENDER RULES (Apply Hold - Confirmation)\n1) Generate a multirecord widget confirmation ONLY after a hold is selected.\n1.1) Multirecord content:\n- Title: 'Confirm Apply Hold'\n- Summary: Render Summary with the following details\n- Description: 'Review the selected hold before continuing.'\n- Records: exactly one record with these fields:\n  - Order Number: <OrderNumber>\n  - Hold Code: <HoldCode>\n  - Hold Name: <HoldName>\n  - Hold Comments: <HoldComments> (render empty if null)\n  - Hold Applied By: <LoggedInUser> (render empty if null)\n\n2) Generate an actionable insight with the following details under the multirecord widget:\n- label: 'Apply Hold'\n  followUpCommand: ora.Agent({ \"action\":\"APPLY_HOLD\", \"OrderNumber\":\"<OrderNumber>\", \"HeaderId\":\"<HeaderId>\", \"HoldCode\":\"<HoldCode>\", \"HoldName\":\"<HoldName>\", \"HoldComments\":\"<HoldComments>\" })\n\nIMPORTANT RULES\n- Render exactly one multirecord widget for details.\n- Put the buttons on the actionable insight, not inside a nested card.\n- Replace all placeholders with values from CONTEXT BINDINGS.\n- If HoldComments is null, still render the field with an empty value.\n- If a HoldCode contains underscores, output it with zero-width spaces around each underscore to prevent italic rendering, while keeping the visible text unchanged.\n- Do NOT output anything outside widget definitions.\n- Rendering only."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
