          "id": "1772196308485",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772196308488_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "TASK:\nGenerate a structured summary for the application using holdCount and exceptionCount.\n\nINPUT:\nholdDetails: {{$context.$nodes.GET_PRICE_HOLD_ORDER_DATA.$output}}\nexceptionDetails: {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_EXCEPTIONS_RELATED_CURATED_DATA.$output}}\nholdCount: {{$context.$nodes.GET_HOLDS_COUNT.$output.result}}\nexceptionCount: {{$context.$nodes.GET_EXCEPTIONS_COUNT.$output.result}}\n\n====================================================\nLOGIC (STRICT)\n====================================================\n\n- hasHolds = holdCount > 0\n- hasExceptions = exceptionCount > 0\n\n====================================================\nSUMMARY GENERATION (STRICT)\n====================================================\n\nRender just exactly: \"<exceptionCount> orders are in exception, impacting order fulfillment. <holdCount> orders are on price hold. Please review priority actions\"\n\n**Replace: <exceptionCount> and <holdCount> with actual values from input.\n\n====================================================\nCRITICAL RULES (NON-NEGOTIABLE)\n====================================================\n\n- Replace <holdCount> and <exceptionCount> with numeric digits ONLY (e.g., 4, 8)\n- DO NOT spell numbers as words\n- DO NOT rephrase sentences\n- DO NOT add extra words\n- DO NOT merge sentences\n- DO NOT change punctuation\n- Use EXACT sentence templates\n\n\n====================================================\nOUTPUT RULES\n====================================================\n\n- MUST return EXACTLY 2 lines\n- Each line MUST be a single sentence\n- MUST include numeric counts\n- NO extra text or formatting\n\n====================================================\nOUTPUT:\nReturn ONLY the final summary\n\n====================================================\nEXAMPLES\n====================================================\n\nWhen:\nInput:\nholdCount = 4\nexceptionCount = 6\n\nOutput:\n6 orders are in exception, impacting order fulfillment. 4 orders are on price hold. Please review priority actions.\n----------------------------------------------------\n\nWhen:\nInput:\nholdCount = 0\nexceptionCount = 0\n\nOutput:\n0 orders on price hold : 0 orders are in exception. No action required."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
