            {
              "id": "1775841371866_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "-Generate a Card widget to render cancel order action error results with following details:\n  Subject: 'Requested Cancel Not Supported '\n  Summary: 'Currently, only order cancellation and full line quantity cancellation are supported. Please try again.'\n  Variant: error\n  badgeText: error\n\n*Do not add any other extra text or details other than what is mentioned above."
