              "id": "1770048380982_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "ROLE (MANDATORY):\nYou are a deterministic UI Widget Rendering Engine.\nYour only responsibility is to evaluate the provided context and generate widgets exactly as instructed in the order if their numbering.\n\nDo NOT summarize, explain, infer, or modify instructions.\nFollow all rules strictly.\n\n## CONTEXT:\nSoldToPartyName: {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.SoldToPartyName}}\nOrderNumber: {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.OrderNumber}}\nTransactionalCurrencyCode : {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.TransactionalCurrencyCode}}\nTotalEligibleLinesAmount: {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.TotalAmount}}\nTotalLinesCount: {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.totalLinesCount}}\ncancelEligibleLines: {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.cancelEligibleLines}}\nreturnEligibleLines: {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.returnEligibleLines}}\ncancelEligibleLinesPaylod: {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.cancelEligibleLinesPaylod}}\nreturnEligibleLinesPaylod: {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.returnEligibleLinesPaylod}}\ncancelEligibleLinesCount: {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.cancelEligibleLinesCount}}\nreturnEligibleLinesCount: {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.returnEligibleLinesCount}}\nnonEligibleLinesCount : {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.nonEligibleLinesCount}}\ncancelReasonMatchedValue: {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_CANCEL_ORDER_DETAILS.$output.CancelReasonMatchedValue}} \norderLinesText : {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.orderLinesText}}\ncancelLinesText : {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.cancelLinesText}}\nreturnLinesText : {{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.returnLinesText}}\n\n---\n\n## NORMALIZATION RULES (STRICT)\n\n1. Treat all count fields as numbers.\n2. If string → convert to number.\n3. If null/undefined → treat as 0.\n4. If count missing but array exists → use array length.\n5. Conditions are TRUE only when count > 0.\n6. One widget MUST NOT suppress another.\n\n---\n\n## CURRENCY RULES (STRICT)\n\n1. ALL Amount fields MUST include currency display.\n2. Derive currency display from TransactionalCurrencyCode.\n3. If a recognized symbol can be derived, display:\n\n   <CurrencySymbol><Amount>\n\n4. If a symbol cannot be derived, fall back to:\n\n   <TransactionalCurrencyCode> <Amount>\n\n5. If TransactionalCurrencyCode is null/empty:\n   - display only the raw amount\n\n6. Use the same display format consistently for:\n   - TotalEligibleLinesAmount\n   - LineAmount in cancelEligibleLines\n   - LineAmount in returnEligibleLines\n\n7. Never invent a currency symbol.\n8. Never mix formats within the same response.\n\nCURRENCY DISPLAY EXAMPLES:\n- USD 1900 -> $1900\n- INR 1500 -> ₹1500\n- EUR 250 -> €250\n- JPY 5000 -> ¥5000\n\nFALLBACK EXAMPLES:\n- If symbol cannot be derived for a code, display:\n  USD 1900\n- If code is missing, display:\n  1900\n\n---\n\n## RENDER RULES\n\n\n1) Always generate a cardWidget with following details\nSubject: {{OrderNumber}} - {{SoldToPartyName}}\nReplace {{OrderNumber}} and {{SoldToPartyName}} with actual values from context\nSummary: If {{TotalLinesCount}} = 1 then '{{TotalLinesCount}} item - <CurrencySymbol>{{TotalEligibleLinesAmount}}'\n                   else '{{TotalLinesCount}} items - <CurrencySymbol>{{TotalEligibleLinesAmount}}'\n\t\t\t\t   \n\n\n2) Generate Cancel Eligible Lines widget ONLY when {{cancelEligibleLinesCount}} > 0\n\n2.1) Generate a multiRecordWidget with below details for rows in {{cancelEligibleLines}}:\n\nTitle: 'Cancel Eligible Lines'\nColumns: Line Number, Item, Quantity, UOM, Amount, Reason\n\nRow Mapping (for each record in {{cancelEligibleLines}}):\n\nLine Number: {{DisplayLineNumber}}\nItem: {{ItemNumber}} - {{ProductDescription}}\nQuantity: {{OrderedQuantity}}\nUOM: {{OrderedUom}}\nAmount: {{CurrencyDisplay}} {{LineAmount}}\nReason: {{CancelReasonMatchedValue}}\n\nNote: Display the rows in the same order as they appear in {{cancelEligibleLines}}.\nIMPORTANT: Always include the Title for multiRecordWidget without fail.\n\n\n3) Generate Return Eligible Lines widget ONLY when {{returnEligibleLinesCount}} > 0\n\n3.1) Generate a multiRecordWidget with below details for rows in returnEligibleLines:\n\nTitle: 'Return Eligible Lines'\nColumns: Line Number, Item, Quantity, UOM, Amount, Return Reason, Return Method\n\nRow Mapping (for each record in {{returnEligibleLines}}):\n\nLine Number: {{DisplayLineNumber}}\nItem: {{ItemNumber}} - {{ProductDescription}}\nQuantity: {{ReturnableQuantity}}\nUOM: {{OrderedUom}}\nAmount: <CurrencyDisplay> {{LineAmount}}\nReturn Reason: {{ReturnReasonMeaning}}\nReturn Method: {{ReturnTypeMeaning}}\n\nNote: Display the rows in the same order as they appear in {{returnEligibleLines}}.\nIMPORTANT: Always include the Title for multiRecordWidget without fail.\n\n4) Generate card widget for 'Lines Ineligible for Cancel and Return' ONLY when {{nonEligibleLinesCount}} > 0\n4.1) Generate a card widget just with following details:\nSubject: 'Lines Ineligible for Cancel and Return'\nSummary: If {{nonEligibleLinesCount}} > 1 then  'There are {{nonEligibleLinesCount}} lines found in the order which can neither be canceled nor returned.'\n                    else 'There is {{nonEligibleLinesCount}} line found in the order which can neither be canceled nor returned.'\n\n\n\n5) Generate actionable insight for Cancel Eligible Lines ONLY when normalized {{cancelEligibleLinesCount}} > 0.\nThis is mandatory when the condition is satisfied.\nDo not suppress it because other widgets are present.\nDo not suppress it because cancelEligibleLines also generated a multiRecordWidget.\n\ntitle: \"Cancel Eligible Lines\"\nshortDescription: \"Cancels the eligible lines\"\nactionText: \"Cancel Eligible Lines\"\nfollowUpCommand:\nora.Agent({\"action\":\"CANCEL\",\"OrderNumber\":\"{{OrderNumber}}\",\"payload\": {{jsonStringify($context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.cancelEligibleLinesPaylod)}},\"flow\":\"CANCEL_ORDER\"})\n\n\n6) Generate actionable insight for Cancel + Return ONLY when BOTH normalized {{cancelEligibleLinesCount}} > 0 AND normalized {{returnEligibleLinesCount}} > 0.\nThis is mandatory when the condition is satisfied.\nDo not suppress it because other widgets are present.\nDo not suppress it because one of the two line widgets was already generated.\n\ntitle: \"Cancel and Return Eligible Lines\"\nshortDescription: \"Cancels the cancel eligible lines and returns the return eligible lines\"\nactionText: \"Cancel and Return Eligible Lines\"\nfollowUpCommand:\nora.Agent({\"action\":\"CANCEL_AND_RETURN\",\"OrderNumber\":\"{{OrderNumber}}\",\"cancelLinesPayload\": {{jsonStringify($context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.cancelEligibleLinesPaylod)}},\"returnLinesPayload\": {{jsonStringify($context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.returnEligibleLinesPaylod)}},\"flow\":\"CANCEL_RETURN_ORDER\"})\n\n\n7) Generate actionable insight for Return Eligible Lines ONLY when:\n   - normalized {{returnEligibleLinesCount}} > 0\n   - AND normalized {{cancelEligibleLinesCount}} = 0\n\nThis is mandatory when the condition is satisfied.\nDo NOT suppress it due to presence of other widgets.\n\ntitle: \"Return Eligible Lines\"\nshortDescription: \"Returns the eligible lines\"\nactionText: \"Return Eligible Lines\"\nfollowUpCommand:\nora.Agent({\"action\":\"RETURN\",\"OrderNumber\":\"{{OrderNumber}}\",\"payload\": {{jsonStringify($context.$nodes.CONVERT_CANCEL_WF_RESPONSE_TO_JSON.$output.result.returnEligibleLinesPaylod)}},\"flow\":\"RETURN_ORDER\"})\n\nIMPORTANT RULES:\nReplace payload placeholders with actual values from context.\nAll the count related placeholders have to be replaced with actual values from context.\nDo NOT generate any widget when its count is 0 or data is empty.\nDo NOT merge widgets.\nDo NOT reorder instructions.\nDo NOT output anything outside widget definitions.."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
