          "convergenceTargetId": "1776699603734",
          "id": "1776575694979",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776575694981_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Task** \nYou are given a list of holds and a user message. Holds: {{$context.$nodes.GETALLHOLDCODES.$output}}\nUser message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n**Workflow**\n1. Read the user message and extract the hold intent or hold-related phrase.\n2. Perform a fuzzy match against the Holds list using:\n   - HoldCode\n   - HoldName\n   - HoldDescription\n\n3. Carefully parse the user's query and understand the intention of the user. You need to figure out which hold code the user can be talking about.\n\n4. Go through the list of all hold codes and come up with a match percentage for each hold code (MatchPercentage: 0–100).\n\n5. Keep only holds with MatchPercentage >= 80.\n\n6. Do not merge different HoldCodes, even if they are semantically similar.\n\n7. Do not stop after the first strong match; evaluate all unique HoldCodes before selecting the top results.\n\n8. Select up to the top 4 by MatchPercentage (descending). If fewer than 4 matches meet the threshold, return only those fewer results.\n\n9. If no HoldCode has MatchPercentage >= 80, return an empty JSON array.\n\n10. Produce a JSON array “MatchingHoldCodes” with items in this format:\n[\n  {\n    \"HoldCode\": \"<Hold Code 1>\",\n    \"HoldName\": \"<Hold Name 1>\",\n    \"HoldDescription\": \"<Hold Description 1>\",\n    \"MatchPercentage\": <MatchPercentage1>\n  },\n  {\n    \"HoldCode\": \"<Hold Code 2>\",\n    \"HoldName\": \"<Hold Name 2>\",\n    \"HoldDescription\": \"<Hold Description 2>\",\n    \"MatchPercentage\": <MatchPercentage2>\n  },\n  {\n    \"HoldCode\": \"<Hold Code 3>\",\n    \"HoldName\": \"<Hold Name 3>\",\n    \"HoldDescription\": \"<Hold Description 3>\",\n    \"MatchPercentage\": <MatchPercentage3>\n  },\n  {\n    \"HoldCode\": \"<Hold Code 4>\",\n    \"HoldName\": \"<Hold Name 4>\",\n    \"HoldDescription\": \"<Hold Description 4>\",\n    \"MatchPercentage\": <MatchPercentage4>\n  }\n]\n\n11. Set the output variable \"MatchingHoldCodes\" to this JSON. Ensure that it is valid JSON.\n\n12. Output nothing else."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"MatchingHoldCodes\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 0,\n      \"maxItems\": 4,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"HoldCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"HoldName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"HoldDescription\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"MatchPercentage\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\",\n            \"minimum\": 0,\n            \"maximum\": 100\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"HoldCode\",\n          \"HoldName\",\n          \"HoldDescription\",\n          \"MatchPercentage\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"MatchingHoldCodes\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
